[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 141 Sally's",
    "start": 1.51,
    "end": 5.692,
    "zh": "第141课 萨莉的",
    "zh_hant": "第141課 薩莉的"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "first train ride",
    "start": 5.472,
    "end": 7.153,
    "zh": "第一次坐火车",
    "zh_hant": "第一次坐火車"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 8.974,
    "end": 12.215,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Why was the mother embarrassed?",
    "start": 14.376,
    "end": 16.877,
    "zh": "为什么母亲感到尴尬？",
    "zh_hant": "為什麼母親感到尷尬？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Last week,",
    "start": 19.279,
    "end": 20.479,
    "zh": "上周，",
    "zh_hant": "上週，"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "my four-year-old daughter,",
    "start": 20.66,
    "end": 22.9,
    "zh": "我四岁的女儿，",
    "zh_hant": "我四歲的女兒，"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Sally, was invited to a children's party.",
    "start": 22.821,
    "end": 26.362,
    "zh": "萨莉，应邀参加了一个儿童聚会。",
    "zh_hant": "薩莉，應邀參加了一個兒童聚會。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "I decided to take her by train.",
    "start": 27.223,
    "end": 29.684,
    "zh": "我决定带她坐火车去。",
    "zh_hant": "我決定帶她坐火車去。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Sally was very excited",
    "start": 30.885,
    "end": 33.085,
    "zh": "萨莉非常兴奋，",
    "zh_hant": "薩莉非常興奮，"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "because she had never travelled on a train before.",
    "start": 32.986,
    "end": 36.087,
    "zh": "因为她以前从未坐过火车。",
    "zh_hant": "因為她以前從未坐過火車。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "She sat near the window",
    "start": 36.988,
    "end": 39.048,
    "zh": "她坐在窗边，",
    "zh_hant": "她坐在窗邊，"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "and asked questions about everything she saw.",
    "start": 39.089,
    "end": 42.811,
    "zh": "看到什么就问什么。",
    "zh_hant": "看到什麼就問什麼。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Suddenly,",
    "start": 43.972,
    "end": 44.972,
    "zh": "突然，",
    "zh_hant": "突然，"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "a middle-age lady got on the train and sat opposite Sally.",
    "start": 45.192,
    "end": 49.574,
    "zh": "一位中年女士上了火车，坐在萨莉对面。",
    "zh_hant": "一位中年女士上了火車，坐在薩莉對面。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "'Hello, little girl,' she said.",
    "start": 50.735,
    "end": 53.536,
    "zh": "“你好，小姑娘，”她说。",
    "zh_hant": "“你好，小姑娘，”她說。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Sally did not answer, but looked at her curiously.",
    "start": 54.397,
    "end": 58.358,
    "zh": "萨莉没有回答，而是好奇地看着她。",
    "zh_hant": "薩莉沒有回答，而是好奇地看著她。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "The lady was dressed in a blue coat",
    "start": 59.279,
    "end": 62.0,
    "zh": "那位女士穿着一件蓝色外套，",
    "zh_hant": "那位女士穿著一件藍色外套，"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "and a large, funny hat.",
    "start": 62.12,
    "end": 64.761,
    "zh": "戴着一顶又大又滑稽的帽子。",
    "zh_hant": "戴著一頂又大又滑稽的帽子。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "After the train had left the station,",
    "start": 66.042,
    "end": 68.583,
    "zh": "火车离开车站后，",
    "zh_hant": "火車離開車站後，"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "the lady opened her handbag and took",
    "start": 68.764,
    "end": 71.865,
    "zh": "那位女士打开手提包，取出",
    "zh_hant": "那位女士開啟手提包，取出"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "out her powder compact.",
    "start": 71.515,
    "end": 73.466,
    "zh": "她的粉饼盒。",
    "zh_hant": "她的粉餅盒。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "She then began to make up her face.",
    "start": 74.306,
    "end": 76.987,
    "zh": "然后她开始往脸上化妆。",
    "zh_hant": "然後她開始往臉上化妝。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "'Why are you doing that?'",
    "start": 77.088,
    "end": 81.43,
    "zh": "“你为什么那样做？”",
    "zh_hant": "“你為什麼那樣做？”"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "Sally asked.",
    "start": 81.08,
    "end": 82.391,
    "zh": "萨莉问。",
    "zh_hant": "薩莉問。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "'To make myself beautiful,'",
    "start": 83.533,
    "end": 86.875,
    "zh": "“为了让我变漂亮，”",
    "zh_hant": "“為了讓我變漂亮，”"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "the lady answered.",
    "start": 86.635,
    "end": 88.236,
    "zh": "那位女士回答。",
    "zh_hant": "那位女士回答。"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "She put away her compact and smiled kindly.",
    "start": 89.418,
    "end": 93.1,
    "zh": "她收起粉饼盒，和蔼地笑了笑。",
    "zh_hant": "她收起粉餅盒，和藹地笑了笑。"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "'But you are still ugly,'",
    "start": 92.881,
    "end": 96.684,
    "zh": "“可你还是丑，”",
    "zh_hant": "“可你還是醜，”"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "Sally said.",
    "start": 96.764,
    "end": 98.005,
    "zh": "萨莉说。",
    "zh_hant": "薩莉說。"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "Sally was amused,",
    "start": 98.626,
    "end": 100.267,
    "zh": "萨莉觉得好玩，",
    "zh_hant": "薩莉覺得好玩，"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "but I was very embarrassed!",
    "start": 100.307,
    "end": 104.01,
    "zh": "但我非常尴尬！",
    "zh_hant": "但我非常尷尬！"
  }
]
